- Keep watchman spend and successor updates atomic and retryable.
  Split progress reuses its current database transaction and accounts for the
  previous child fee when it replaces a package.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
- Keep Lightning retries tied to their recorded inputs and invoice.
  Report admission errors to callers. Cancel a receive and its linked attempt
  in one transaction.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
- Keep recovery mailbox hints free of owner metadata.
  Cached receive grant retries no longer write owner bindings. Round undo
  removes the owner projections for its deleted outputs.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
- Preserve the cached forfeit nonce for concurrent retries.
  Reject overflowing Lightning HTLC output totals as invalid requests.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
